[00:12.30] Forefather pointed to kingdom come
[00:15.19] Sadly told his only son
[00:18.26] Just be careful what you do
[00:21.08] It all comes back on you.
[00:24.37] False witness spread the news
[00:27.12] Somebody's gonna lose
[00:29.92] Either she or me or you,
[00:32.97] Nothing we can do.
[00:35.26] (Chorus)
[00:36.04] Don't you say a word
[00:39.56] Or reveal a thing you've learned
[00:42.51] Time will tell you well
[00:47.06] If you truly, truly fell
[00:52.28] Tarred and feathered, yea!
[00:55.26] Thistled and thorned,
[00:58.15] One or the other
[01:01.43] He kindly warned.
[01:04.14] Now you look out the window tell me
[01:06.90] What do you see?
[01:10.38] I see a golden calf pointing
[01:13.14] Back at me.
[01:15.79] I been sitting in here for so darn long
[01:18.73] Waitin' for the end to come along.
[01:21.58] Holy coaster's on the brink
[01:24.21] Take a chance, swim or sink.
[01:27.56] False witness, cast an evil eye
[01:30.35] Said I cannot tell a lie,
[01:33.26] Haints and saints don't bother me
[01:35.92] I'm not alone you see.
[01:39.15] (Chorus)
